    {
      "id": "p0165-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Actual music - accompanied by spooky vocal sounds - plays while these lyrics are displayed. The song seems like random, meaningless nonsense at first, but Toby noted that the song is actually \"Jingle Bells\", the classic popular Christmas song.",
        "raw": "Actual music - accompanied by\nspooky vocal sounds - plays while\nthese lyrics are displayed. The song\nseems like random, meaningless\nnonsense at first, but Toby noted that\nthe song is actually \"Jingle Bells\", the\nclassic popular Christmas song.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09020946,
          0.37641429,
          0.37940378,
          0.49972857
        ],
