    {
      "id": "p0165-b009",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "As we've already seen, classic Christmas songs are known in Japan, and many of them have received multiple translations into Japanese. I wonder if there are ever heated arguments about which version of \"Jingle Bells\" is the \"truer\" translation",
